{ "data": { "text": "The presence of a connection between two nodes (i and j) was determined by completing a time series regression analysis. This produced a cross-correlation matrix, which represents the Pearson's correlation coefficient that describes the connectivity between every network node. A threshold was then chosen to dichotomize the data and create the final binary adjacency matrix (Aij) where values above the threshold indicate a connection is present. The threshold ensures that the density of connections was comparable across all the participants. More specifically, S = log (N)/log (K) is conserved across the participants. Our networks were thresholded at S = 2.5 based on previous work.\n\nThe strength of community structures was identified using network modularity or Q. A dynamic Markov process was used to maximize Q and partition the brain networks into communities. It was run 100 times, and the partition associated with the highest Q value was chosen." }, "annotations": [ { "result": [ { "from_name": "Compute connectivity", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 185, "end": 211, "text": "Pearson's correlation coefficient", "labels": [ "Compute connectivity — Algorithm" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph characteristics", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 352, "end": 374, "text": "binary adjacency matrix", "labels": [ "Graph characteristics — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Sparsity control", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 642, "end": 652, "text": "thresholded", "labels": [ "Sparsity control — Algorithm/Type" ] } }, { "from_name": "Sparsity control", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 566, "end": 584, "text": "S = log (N)/log (K)", "labels": [ "Sparsity control — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Sparsity control", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 657, "end": 663, "text": "S = 2.5", "labels": [ "Sparsity control — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 732, "end": 751, "text": "modularity or Q", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Network definition", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 756, "end": 780, "text": "dynamic Markov process", "labels": [ "Network definition — Algorithm" ] } }, { "from_name": "Network definition", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 860, "end": 871, "text": "100 times", "labels": [ "Network definition — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Compute connectivity", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 185, "end": 186, "text": "1", "labels": [ "Compute connectivity — Step Number" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph characteristics", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 352, "end": 353, "text": "2", "labels": [ "Graph characteristics — Step Number" ] } }, { "from_name": "Sparsity control", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 642, "end": 643, "text": "3", "labels": [ "Sparsity control — Step Number" ] } }, { "from_name": "Network definition", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 756, "end": 757, "text": "4", "labels": [ "Network definition — Step Number" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 732, "end": 733, "text": "5", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Step Number" ] } } ] } ] }